      "text": "I have become mildly obsessed with the process of learning new skills.\n\nIn many ways, it feels like one of the few fulfilling &amp; sustainable meta-activities.\n\nWhat’s the most rewarding skill you’ve ever learned?",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1608925886761533442"
