        "like_count": 420,
        "quote_count": 7,
        "reply_count": 17,
        "retweet_count": 27
      },
      "text": "Vitality is a strategy\n\nI was learning to snowboard, and the reality is—to learn, you get beat up on the slopes.\n\nThis is true of learning anything—it requires you to endure some falls, even with perfect theoretical knowledge.\n\nYou must fall and get back up. That's the strategy.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1608510792764370944"
