      },
      "text": "The first thing you have to unlearn as an Adult is:\n\nStop worrying about the BS everyone else is worried about.\n\nCollege apps &amp; similar games train you to think the crowds are right and we should all care about the same thing\n\nNot true. You win by focusing on new &amp; secret metrics",
