        "quote_count": 83,
        "reply_count": 461,
        "retweet_count": 136
      },
      "text": "I’m not a parent nor a child development expert…\n\nBut it does seem like the best way to avoid having Normie kids is to allow them to play video games\n\n…and it’s definitely the best way to get them interested in computers\n\nWhy do parents crusade against video games so much?",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1607054202496487425"
