      "text": "In Colorado skiing with the family, and it is gorgeous.\n\nBut, gotta say… missing San Francisco.\n\nDespite all the fair criticisms, there’s nowhere else where it feels like the future of the world is being actively invented.\n\nNYC/Miami/LA/Austin/London-heads, prove me wrong 🙃",
