      "text": "Execution is paranoia.\nOperating is paranoia.\n\nWhile deeply uncomfortable and anxiety-inducing, there isn’t another way I know to be successful.\n\nThe best operators are always looking around corners, wondering what people aren’t telling them, and asking what may go wrong.",
