        "id": "1607042844182851584",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 133,
          "impression_count": 77178,
          "like_count": 436,
          "quote_count": 2,
          "reply_count": 16,
          "retweet_count": 46
        },
        "text": "Heard someone say “I don’t want to waste brain space on learning Chinese”\n\nPSA—that’s not how it works at all.\n\nConsistently *retrieving* information both deepens connections with the rest of your knowledge and frees up resources &amp; working memory for more abstract thought.\n\n🧵"
      },
